timestamp_updated": 1655675808, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.388749033212661743", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "117220385", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009277477", "personaname": "G²", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009277477/", "num_games_owned": 1203, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 3003, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3003, "last_played": 1586757817, "avatar": "1b94c5d69f7f070d48d528138c59c15c45621f65"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the better 2D rougelike performer's out there. Fun and allows for many different types of play styles. Only issue I have with it is the multiplayer bugs.\n\nIf you have friends and play multiplayer, the drop rate for items sometimes is low. This makes it a bit harder to build as you can't share items and it becomes a point where most likely one friend will be behind. The other issue is if you die on multiplayer and your friends move on to the next stage, your UI stops working. \n\nUnfortunately these bugs won't ever get fixed due to them working on Risk of Rain 2, which is objectively better then this but it's nice to go back to the classic once in a while. Also the bugs are only multiplayer so shouldn't have any issues if you want to pick this up and play solo. For that reason, I can't give this a no, but understand it's a \"ok\" yes.", "timestamp_created": 1655617485, "timestamp_updated": 1655617485, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}